# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# RAG PDF Chatbot — environment variables template
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your real values.
# ⚠️  NEVER commit a .env with real keys to source control!
#
# For cloud deployment, add these as platform secrets instead:
#   • Hugging Face Spaces → Settings → Repository secrets
#   • Streamlit Community Cloud → App Settings → Secrets
#   • Render → Environment → Environment Variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Required — get a free key at https://console.groq.com
GROQ_API_KEY=your_groq_api_key_here

# Optional — change the default model (see app sidebar for all options)
GROQ_MODEL=llama3-8b-8192
